@TURB2BExtra_HostAddress = http://localhost:5094

### Agency guide login
POST {{TURB2BExtra_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "guide@demo.local",
  "password": "Guide123!"
}

### Intermediary owner login
POST {{TURB2BExtra_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "owner@demo.local",
  "password": "Owner123!"
}

### Search hotels
GET {{TURB2BExtra_HostAddress}}/api/hotels
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
